<div class="container page-body">
  <section class="venue-section" id="price" aria-labelledby="h-price">
    <h2 id="h-price">Prices</h2>
    <p class="note">All prices are in New Taiwan dollars. Weekend rates already include the 1.5× weekend charge. Tick any discount on the hire form.</p>
    <h3>Venue hire</h3>
    <div class="table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="The Odeum venue hire prices" tabindex="0"><table class="data-table"><caption>The Odeum venue hire prices</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col" rowspan="2" class="left">Time</th><th scope="colgroup" colspan="2">Rehearsal</th><th scope="colgroup" colspan="2">Performance</th></tr><tr><th scope="col">Weekday</th><th scope="col">Weekend</th><th scope="col">Weekday</th><th scope="col">Weekend</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">09:00–12:00</th><td>3,000</td><td>6,000</td><td>6,000</td><td>12,000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">12:00–13:00 (break, when booked with adjacent slots)</th><td colspan="4">1,000 per hour</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">13:00–17:00</th><td>5,000</td><td>9,000</td><td>8,000</td><td>15,000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">17:00–18:00 (break, when booked with adjacent slots)</th><td colspan="4">1,000 per hour</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">18:00–22:00</th><td>7,000</td><td>12,000</td><td>10,000</td><td>15,000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Deposit</th><td colspan="4">3,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    <h3>Notes on hire fees</h3>
    <ol class="small-list"><li>Slots are charged in full; part slots count as a full slot.</li><li>When rehearsal and performance are on the same day, breaks are charged per hour.</li><li>Get-out must finish within your slot. Overruns are charged at NT$1,000 per hour.</li><li>The deposit is refunded after the venue is handed back in good order.</li><li>Hire fees do not include extra staffing.</li></ol>
    <h3>Discounts</h3>
    <div class="table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Hire fee discounts" tabindex="0"><table class="data-table"><caption>Hire fee discounts</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col" class="left">Who qualifies</th><th scope="col">Weekday</th><th scope="col">Weekend</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">NTU students, student clubs, university units and alumni groups</th><td>10% off</td><td>10% off</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Free events organised by the College of Management or its student associations</th><td>Free</td><td>30% off</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Events co-organised by the College of Management or its student associations</th><td>30% off</td><td>10% off</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    <h3>Equipment hire</h3>
    <div class="table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="The Odeum equipment hire prices" tabindex="0"><table class="data-table"><caption>The Odeum equipment hire prices</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col" rowspan="2" class="left">Item</th><th scope="colgroup" colspan="2">Rehearsal</th><th scope="colgroup" colspan="2">Performance</th></tr><tr><th scope="col">Weekday</th><th scope="col">Weekend</th><th scope="col">Weekday</th><th scope="col">Weekend</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Projector</th><td>2,000</td><td>3,000</td><td>4,000</td><td>6,000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">240-inch screen</th><td>2,000</td><td>3,000</td><td>4,000</td><td>6,000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Wireless microphone</th><td>1,000</td><td>1,500</td><td>1,000</td><td>1,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">CD player</th><td>500</td><td>750</td><td>500</td><td>750</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">DVD player</th><td>500</td><td>750</td><td>500</td><td>750</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Grand piano</th><td>3,000</td><td>4,500</td><td>6,000</td><td>9,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    <h3>Notes on equipment</h3>
    <ol class="small-list"><li>Piano tuning is charged separately; please note it on the form.</li><li>Own lighting equipment is not permitted.</li><li>Piano recitals may also apply to the <a href="/en/calls/music-box.html" title="Chapel Music Box">Chapel Music Box</a> scheme.</li></ol>
  </section>
  <section class="venue-section" id="schedule" aria-labelledby="h-schedule">
    <h2 id="h-schedule">Availability</h2>
    <div class="calendar-embed">Availability calendar (existing Google Calendar; the iframe needs a title)</div>
    <div class="prose small"><p>When 2026 slots open for applications</p><ul><li>Jan–Feb: from 26 Nov 2025</li><li>Mar–Jun: from 31 Dec 2025</li><li>Jul–Aug: from 28 Apr 2026</li><li>Sep–Dec: from 27 May 2026</li></ul>
    <p>“Center reserved” marks our own programmes; “Booked” marks hired dates.</p><p><a href="https://calendar.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Open the calendar (opens in a new window)">Open the calendar<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new window)</span></a></p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="venue-section" id="steps" aria-labelledby="h-steps">
    <h2 id="h-steps">How to apply</h2>
    <p class="note spaced">Applications are made on paper or by email. There is no online form.</p>
    <ol class="steps"><li><p class="n" aria-hidden="true">1</p><h3>Check availability</h3><p>See Availability on this page, or contact us.</p></li><li><p class="n" aria-hidden="true">2</p><h3>Submit</h3><p>By the start of the month two months before your booking, deliver or post the stamped form with your event plan.</p></li><li><p class="n" aria-hidden="true">3</p><h3>Review</h3><p>We will reply within two weeks.</p></li><li><p class="n" aria-hidden="true">4</p><h3>Pay</h3><p>Pay the hire fee and deposit by the date on your invoice.</p></li><li><p class="n" aria-hidden="true">5</p><h3>On the day</h3><p>We provide at least one front-of-house and one backstage staff member.</p></li></ol>
  </section>
