  <section class="venue-section" id="faq" aria-labelledby="h-faq">
    <h2 id="h-faq">FAQ</h2>
    <details class="faq" open><summary>How do I check availability?</summary><div class="answer"><p>See <a href="#schedule" title="Availability">Availability</a> on this page, or call 02-3366-4782.</p></div></details><details class="faq"><summary>What happens after my application is approved?</summary><div class="answer"><p>Pay by the date on your invoice, and send your technical rider and running order two weeks before the event.</p></div></details><details class="faq"><summary>Are there discounts for NTU students and alumni?</summary><div class="answer"><p>Yes. See the discounts under <a href="#price" title="Prices">Prices</a> and tick the category that applies on the form.</p></div></details>
  </section>
